      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "STUDIES validating prognostic models that predicted all cause and cardiovascular mortality, admission to hospital for heart failure, kidney failure, myocardial infarction, or ischaemic stroke in adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus",
      "reason": "The evidence specifies several eligibility components related to the target population and outcomes (adults with type 2 diabetes; specific mortality and event outcomes). However, it does not explicitly specify eligible study designs, settings, or follow-up requirements, nor a complete set of “question-framework” components."
    },
